us, and problem detail for each requested assignment.\",\n  \"when\": \"A client sends POST /lots/mappings with valid assignments.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-1\",\n  \"given\": \"The requested lot exists and the assumption values are valid.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-1.7\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the returned forecast contains the updated target weight and gain rate, gain-rate basis, projected market date, and recommendations.\",\n  \"when\": \"A client sends PATCH /lots/{lotId}/assumptions with targetWeightLb and defaultGainRateLbPerDay.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-1\",\n  \"given\": \"The requested lot exists.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-1.8\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the returned forecast contains targetWeightLb, gainRateLbPerDay, gainRateBasis, projectedMarketDate, and recommendations.\",\n  \"when\": \"A client sends GET /lots/{lotId}/forecast.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-1\",\n  \"given\": \"Feed inventory records exist.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-1.9\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the returned inventory response contains wastageRatio and item records with contract stock totals, item properties, and movement history.\",\n  \"when\": \"A client sends GET /inventory/items.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-1\",\n  \"given\": \"The inventory item exists and a received or adjustment movement is valid.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-1.10\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 201 and the returned movement and item reflect the submitted itemId, movementType, date, quantityLb, and note, including updated stock fields.\",\n  \"when\": \"A client sends POST /inventory/movements.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-1\",\n  \"given\": \"The inventory item exists and the actual-wastage request is valid.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-1.11\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 201 and the returned movement and item include the actual_wastage quantit